Hi,

this is not R-code, sorry, we havn't got to that point. so better do

loghc = "expressiion:
          scale = 25;
          ld = -log(pi * scale) -log(1 + (x/scale)^2);
         return (ld);"

if you want to for the precision, then you  need to  this

loghc = "expressiion:
          prec = exp(theta);
          scale = 25;
          ld = -log(pi * scale) -log(1 + (prec/scale)^2);
          logjac = theta;
         return (ld + logjac);"

since you must give the prior for theta = log(prec), not
prec itself ;-)

